    "Hold Fn + Shift to reply" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fn + Umschalt halten, um zu antworten"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hold Fn + Shift to reply"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mantenga Fn + Mayúsculas para responder"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tieni premuti Fn + Maiusc per rispondere"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Segure Fn + Shift para responder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold Fn and Shift to ask a question and hear the answer. Talk needs a free Autohand account; you can also set it up later in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halten Sie Fn und Umschalt, um eine Frage zu stellen und die Antwort zu hören. Sprechen benötigt ein kostenloses Autohand-Konto; Sie können es auch später in den Einstellungen einrichten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hold Fn and Shift to ask a question and hear the answer. Talk needs a free Autohand account; you can also set it up later in Settings."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mantenga Fn y Mayúsculas para hacer una pregunta y escuchar la respuesta. Hablar necesita una cuenta gratuita de Autohand; también puede configurarla más tarde en Ajustes."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tieni premuti Fn e Maiusc per fare una domanda e ascoltare la risposta. Parla richiede un account Autohand gratuito; puoi configurarlo anche più tardi nelle Impostazioni."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Segure Fn e Shift para fazer uma pergunta e ouvir a resposta. Conversar precisa de uma conta Autohand gratuita; você também pode configurá-la depois em Ajustes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold Fn and Shift, ask your question, then let go. Fantail answers out loud and on screen. Hold Fn and Shift again to follow up." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halten Sie Fn und Umschalt, stellen Sie Ihre Frage und lassen Sie los. Fantail antwortet laut und auf dem Bildschirm. Halten Sie Fn und Umschalt erneut, um nachzufragen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hold Fn and Shift, ask your question, then let go. Fantail answers out loud and on screen. Hold Fn and Shift again to follow up."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mantenga Fn y Mayúsculas, haga su pregunta y suelte. Fantail responde en voz alta y en pantalla. Vuelva a mantener Fn y Mayúsculas para seguir la conversación."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tieni premuti Fn e Maiusc, fai la tua domanda, poi rilascia. Fantail risponde ad alta voce e sullo schermo. Tieni di nuovo premuti Fn e Maiusc per continuare."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Segure Fn e Shift, faça sua pergunta e solte. O Fantail responde em voz alta e na tela. Segure Fn e Shift de novo para continuar a conversa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold Fn while you speak, then release to finish. Short presses keep their normal macOS behavior." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halten Sie Fn beim Sprechen gedrückt und lassen Sie es los, um zu beenden. Durch kurzes Drücken bleibt das normale macOS-Verhalten erhalten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hold Fn while you speak, then release to finish. Short presses keep their normal macOS behavior."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mantenga presionada la tecla Fn mientras habla y suéltela para finalizar. Las pulsaciones breves mantienen el comportamiento normal de macOS."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tieni premuto Fn mentre parli, poi rilascia per terminare. Le pressioni brevi mantengono il normale comportamento di macOS."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Segure Fn enquanto fala e solte para terminar. Pressões curtas mantêm seu comportamento normal do macOS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold the shortcut while speaking, then release to transcribe. Fn is always hold to talk." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halten Sie das Tastenkürzel beim Sprechen gedrückt und lassen Sie los, um zu transkribieren. Fn funktioniert immer durch Gedrückthalten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hold the shortcut while speaking, then release to transcribe. Fn is always hold to talk."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mantenga presionado el atajo mientras habla y suéltelo para transcribir. Fn siempre funciona manteniéndola presionada."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tieni premuta la scorciatoia mentre parli, poi rilascia per trascrivere. Fn funziona sempre tenendolo premuto."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Segure o atalho enquanto fala e solte para transcrever. Fn sempre funciona mantendo pressionado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Keyboard settings, change the Dictation shortcut away from pressing Fn twice, or turn Dictation off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ändern Sie in den Tastatureinstellungen das Diktierkürzel auf etwas anderes als zweimaliges Drücken von Fn, oder deaktivieren Sie die Diktierfunktion."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In Keyboard settings, change the Dictation shortcut away from pressing Fn twice, or turn Dictation off."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En la configuración de Teclado, cambie el atajo de Dictado para que no sea presionar Fn dos veces, o desactive el Dictado."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nelle impostazioni Tastiera, cambia l'abbreviazione della Dettatura in modo che non sia premere Fn due volte, oppure disattiva la Dettatura."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nos ajustes de Teclado, altere o atalho do Ditado para algo diferente de pressionar Fn duas vezes, ou desative o Ditado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
