    "Talk runs entirely on this Mac. Your audio, questions and replies never leave it. Dictation stays fully on this Mac too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Talk läuft vollständig auf diesem Mac. Audio, Fragen und Antworten verlassen ihn nie. Auch das Diktieren bleibt vollständig auf diesem Mac."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Talk runs entirely on this Mac. Your audio, questions and replies never leave it. Dictation stays fully on this Mac too."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Talk se ejecuta por completo en este Mac. Su audio, sus preguntas y las respuestas nunca salen de él. El dictado también se queda por completo en este Mac."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Talk funziona interamente su questo Mac. Audio, domande e risposte non lo lasciano mai. Anche la dettatura resta interamente su questo Mac."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Talk roda inteiramente neste Mac. Seu áudio, perguntas e respostas nunca saem dele. O ditado também fica inteiramente neste Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On Intel Macs the model runs on the processor and replies take much longer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Auf Intel-Macs läuft das Modell auf dem Prozessor, und Antworten dauern deutlich länger."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On Intel Macs the model runs on the processor and replies take much longer."
          }
        },
